{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_8_level_main_08-04_end",
  "groupId": "main_8",
  "stageId": "main_08-04",
  "title": "火種，一觸即滅",
  "storyCode": "R8-4",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "14988141984bbe147405a1ec1bf5dd6133f96d507eed5c6429bbb36e72245cf8",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snow_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以呢，你打跑了他們，是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒跟你去是對的。用火去燒人......這種味道，我要是再聞到，一定會吐出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿麗娜，別勉強自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以前是我自己要跟著你走的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，我也會保護你們這些感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我不是在求你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那當然不是。阿麗娜，沒有你我就沒時間去搜集資源和資訊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和你通信的人是誰，方便告訴我嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "懷疑我是烏薩斯的間諜嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是在想把你捲進這些事好不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在身為感染者的時候，我們的生活就沒法更壞了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我去聯繫的是其他城市的感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在嘗試從他們那裡更快地瞭解城市的動向，好盡可能地幫上在凍原上生存的感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在做一件......很不得了的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這麼強的正義感是從哪來的？是因為以前有人這麼教過你嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我受到的教育，既惡毒又瘋癲，充滿了統治的傲慢和權力的恐怖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我決定反著走。我要剝掉他們彬彬有禮的皮囊，拆開他們引以為豪的一層接一層的貴族城市，把真相告訴所有人，雪原上的所有人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後我們決定自己的命運。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們去開墾這片大地。我們建立自己的家園，誰不讓我們這麼做，我們就推翻他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這片大地本就有一部分是屬於感染者的......就像這片大地的許多地方，本來就屬於所有人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......現實點，塔露拉。這有點太遙遠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塔露拉，你這樣做，這個村子就徹底毀了。他們將無處可歸，糾察隊會一直跟在他們身後。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不這麼做，那個村子也會逐漸荒廢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是所有人都能成為戰士。老人、孩子、傷病的人，讓他們放棄自己賴以生存的，哪怕是貧瘠的土地，他們也是活不下去的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道，阿麗娜。所以我們要去找新的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來，跟我走，阿麗娜。今晚我們有地方可住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_iceforest_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝你招待我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_094",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪裡，沒有你們，我們可能已經都死了。雖然現在也和死了沒差多少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_094",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很抱歉，一開始對你那樣，我還準備打你。都怪我，不爭氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_094",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能用來招待你們的東西也沒剩下什麼，湊合吃吧，一點麥粥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "非常感謝你，先生，其實沒必要的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_094",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，沒什麼，反正只剩這點了。接下來就過幾天是幾天，沒什麼差別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_094",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想建一個村子，哪怕是這麼遠......也沒用的，都沒什麼用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_094",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們逃不過。烏薩斯這麼大，往哪裡走都沒用，到處都是糾察官......其他人也不會接納你。我們無處可去的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，跟我走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_094",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......去哪？現在？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用是現在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等你們想清楚了，或者真的被逼得無路可去，如果還想活下去，就來找我，或者找我的兄弟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去荒野上的話，凍原的生活......真的很糟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我們有地方可去，我們有未開化的土地，我們去找能耕種能收割的地方；我們還有很多人，他們會幫各個村莊做買賣，也能有收入。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們總能活下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_094",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那要是糾察隊又來了呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——我們戰勝他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_094",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_094",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你剛說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我能做到，你們也能。你剛才拿起武器對著我，是對的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一旦有人去掠奪我們，我們就團結起來打退他們。感染者是有力的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們感染者會一點點重拾自己的生命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "麵包，以及火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
